    <string name="str_termandcondition" translatable="false">Terms &amp; Conditions</string>
    <string name="str_terms_subtitle">Please review the basic shopping rules before using Grocio order features.</string>
    <string name="str_terms_body">By using Grocio, you accept that pricing, product availability, and delivery timing may change with live catalog updates.\n\nKey terms:\n- Orders are treated as confirmed only after successful placement in the app\n- Saved items and cart data are convenience features, not stock reservations\n- Delivery details should be correct before checkout\n- Refund or replacement decisions depend on order verification and product condition</string>
    <string name="str_terms_footer">When Grocio policies change, the latest in-app version applies to future orders. Contact customer support if you need clarification.</string>
